



### Sign Up
POST {{host}}/users/sign-up
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "age": 17
}


### Sign In
# @name signIn
POST {{host}}/users/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}



### Get Profile
GET {{host}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{signIn.response.body.token_jwt}}

###Create Task
POST {{host}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{signIn.response.body.token_jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json    

{
  "name": "Configurar backend",
  "description": "checar gin"
}

### Get Tasks
GET {{host}}/tasks/

### Get Task by ID
GET {{host}}/tasks/1
